<h2 id="jump-in-loop" data-text="Jump within a loop" tabindex="-1">Jump within a loop</h2>

<p>Only jumping between named steps belonging to the same for loop is allowed.
Jumping in or out of a for loop, or between two different for loops, is not
allowed.</p>

<div>
<devsite-selector>
  <section>
  <h3 id="yaml_9" data-text="YAML" tabindex="-1">YAML</h3>
