<h2 id="break-in-loop" data-text="Use break/continue in a loop" tabindex="-1">Use break/continue in a loop</h2>

<p>To change the flow of a for loop, you can use <code translate="no" dir="ltr">next: break</code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr">next: continue</code>.
Note that <code translate="no" dir="ltr">break</code> and <code translate="no" dir="ltr">continue</code> are reserved jump targets defined implicitly
within a loop. Named steps called <code translate="no" dir="ltr">break</code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr">continue</code> within a for loop are
not allowed; however, they are allowed outside of a for loop.</p>

