<h2 id="iterating-list" data-text="Iterate through a list" tabindex="-1">Iterate through a list</h2>

<p>This sample shows how you can use a combination of conditional jumps, variables,
and the <code translate="no" dir="ltr">len()</code> function to iterate through a list.</p>











